think %329 booked and closed: the mark law seated 20260821 and two ladders numbered past it -- FORA drawn after the law and forecast 0 through 31, STOA growing post-law rungs -- because the law lived in the rules and no meter read living mark shapes. The drift measured 17,378 mentions, ALES alone 10,724, much of it citations of ales-named filenames that fall only as those files molt -- which is what a ceiling that only falls absorbs.
